!scripts/deploy.sh
# 下面几个是构建期必须存在的：prebuild 跑 gen-icons，postbuild 跑 check-version /
# check-dist，缺一个整个 npm run build 就会以 Cannot find module 失败。
!scripts/gen-icons.mjs
!scripts/check-version.mjs
!scripts/check-dist.mjs
